---
// Simple footer - NO fancy positioning
---

<footer class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mt-20 md:mt-32 pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <div class="brutal-card bg-black text-white p-6 md:p-12">
        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-12 mb-8">
            <!-- CTA Section -->
            <div class="flex-1">
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-4 font-black uppercase">
                    Conecta y <span class="text-acid">Pide Temas</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base md:text-lg mb-6 opacity-90">
                    ¿Quieres que analicemos algo específico? ¿Tienes una duda existencial sobre IA o Startups? ¡Escríbenos!
                </p>
                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ctala/" 
                   target="_blank"
                   class="brutal-btn bg-acid hover:bg-white text-sm md:text-base inline-block">
                    Proponer Tema
                </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Links Section -->
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 md:w-64">
                <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-black opacity-60 mb-4">
                    Perfiles de LinkedIn:
                </p>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ctala/" 
                       target="_blank"
                       class="block hover:text-acid font-bold border-b border-gray-700 pb-2 transition-colors">
                        Cristian Tala →
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rodrigorojo/" 
                       target="_blank"
                       class="block hover:text-acid font-bold border-b border-gray-700 pb-2 transition-colors">
                        Rodrigo Rojo →
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/godiegoarias/" 
                       target="_blank"
                       class="block hover:text-acid font-bold border-b border-gray-700 pb-2 transition-colors">
                        Diego Arias →
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom Credits -->
        <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-6 text-center">
            <div class="font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-400 mb-2">
                Es la hora de aprender • 2026 • Santiago de Chile
            </div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 opacity-50">
                Build v2.2.0 • Feb 18, 2026 10:35 AM
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
